      "title": "봉인 확인서 서식",
      "enforcement_date": "",
      "content": "■ 어선위치추적장치의 설비 및 운영방법 등에 관한 고시 [별지 제1호서식] <신 설>\n봉인 확인서 서식\n┌───────────────────────────────────────┐\n│Fisheries Monitoring Center (FMC)                                             │\n│638, Gijanghaean-ro, Gijang-eup, Gijang-gun,                                  │\n│Busan, 46079, Republic of Korea                                               │\n│Tel:+82-51-410-1410, Fax:+82-51-410-1409                                      │\n│E-mail: fmc2014@korea.kr                                                      │\n│                                                                              │\n│                                                                              │\n│MM. DD. YYYY.                                                                 │\n│                                                                              │\n│(수신자 또는 업체 정보)                                                       │\n│                                                                              │\n│                                                                              │\n│Confirmation of Official Seals applied to ACL                                 │\n│                                                                              │\n│This is to confirm that the Automatic Location Communicator (ALC)             │\n│installed on board the following vessel has been duly checked and officially  │\n│sealed by the Fisheries Monitoring Center in the Republic of Korea, in        │\n│accordance with the applicable rules and regulations:                         │\n│                                                                              │\n│┌─────────────────────────────────┐        │\n││1. Vessel details:                                                │        │\n│├────────┬────────┬────────┬──────┤        │\n││Name (Kor/Eng)  │                │Flag State      │            │        │\n│├────────┼────────┼────────┼──────┤        │\n││Call Sign       │                │IMO No.         │            │        │\n│├────────┴────────┼────────┴──────┤        │\n││Authorization No. (given by flag  │                              │        │\n││State)                            │                              │        │\n│├─────────────────┴───────────────┤        │\n││2. ALC Information:                                               │        │\n│├────────┬────────┬────────┬──────┤        │\n││ALC Model       │                │Serial No.      │            │        │\n│├────────┼────────┼────────┼──────┤        │\n││ALC Satellite   │                │Date of         │            │        │\n││Type            │                │Installation    │            │        │\n│├────────┼────────┼────────┼──────┤        │\n││ALC Manufacturer│                │                │            │        │\n│├────────┴────────┴────────┴──────┤        │\n││3. Sealing Information:                                           │        │\n│├────────┬────────┬────────┬──────┤        │\n││Type of Sealing │                │Seals applied on│(mm.dd.yyyy)│        │\n│├────────┴────────┼────────┴──────┤        │\n││4. Official Seals: Serial numbers │Location of Application       │        │\n│├─────────────────┼───────────────┤        │\n││1.                                │                              │        │\n│├─────────────────┼───────────────┤        │\n││2.                                │                              │        │\n│├─────────────────┼───────────────┤        │\n││3.                                │                              │        │\n│├─────────────────┼───────────────┤        │\n││4.                                │                              │        │\n│├─────────────────┼───────────────┤        │\n││5.                                │                              │        │\n│└─────────────────┴───────────────┘        │\n│                                                                              │\n│                                                                              │\n│With best regards,                                                            │\n│                                                                              │\n│┌──┐NAME                                                                  │\n││직인│                                                                      │\n│└──┘                                                                      │\n│Head of Fisheries Monitoring Center                                           │\n│Ministry of Oceans and Fisheries                                              │\n│Republic of Korea                                                             │\n└───────────────────────────────────────┘",
